<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54571" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταμύω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		aor.
		inf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καμμῦσαι</span>
		v.l. in
		<i><span class="en">
			Batr.
			191
		</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καμμύειν</span>, aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκάμμυσα</span>, etc., also in later Gr.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καμμύω</span>
			:—<i>close the eyes</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τὰ βλέφαρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyn.</u>
					5.11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὄμματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					7.83
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ὀφθαλμούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
				</span></i>
			(v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καμμύω</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">; τὸ τῆς ψυχῆς ὄμμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.645
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.414
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τῷ νοερῷ ὄμματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					M.Ant.
					4.29
				</span></i>
			: more freq. alone, <i>close the eyes</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				6.1.14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ὑπ᾽ ἐκπλήξεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					6.11
				</span></i>
			: hence, <i>drop asleep, doze</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Batr.
			</span></i> l. c., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				92
			</span></i>: euphem. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταθνῄσκειν</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMeretr.</u>
				7.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				4.49
			</span></i>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῡ</span> in
			pres., <i><span class="en">
				Hedyl.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				8.345a
			</span></i>: in aor., <i><span class="en">
				Batr.
			</span></i> l. c.; 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύω</span>
			.]</div>
